# NOT read by any image build in this repository.
#
# A .dockerignore is read from the build CONTEXT root, and all three images are
# built from a subdirectory:
#
#   helmCharts.kaniko2(dockerfile: 'backend/Dockerfile',       context: 'backend',  ...)
#   helmCharts.kaniko2(dockerfile: 'frontend/Dockerfile',      context: 'frontend', ...)
#   helmCharts.kaniko2(dockerfile: 'frontend/Dockerfile.docs', context: 'frontend', ...)
#
# so the files that matter are backend/.dockerignore and
# frontend/.dockerignore. Edit those. This one is kept only for a future build
# whose context is the repository root; the validation Job's tar (modernApp.test
# in the Jenkinsfile's Test stage) carries its own --exclude flags and does not
# read it either.
**/.git
**/.pnpm-store
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/test-results
